{
  "machine": "sce:std/shared/record_list",
  "about": "A copy of the standard shared record list (sce:std/shared/record_list.scxml) that keeps a journal, the default when its join does not say (docs/adr/0083, docs/adr/0085 section 7.1, docs/adr/0093 section 3): each change it closes is one report to its host on `#journal`, `record_list.made`, the change and the host's command that ended it, and the copy takes the change in only at the host's verdict, then reports the outcome, `record_list.closed`. Accepted and held take the change in; waiting takes it in provisionally; refused takes nothing in, so the copy holds what it held before the close, its clock stays at the refused stamp, which no change is given again, and the outcome gives the reason the verdict gave (`noRoomForHistory` for a layer whose log is full). A change the copy refuses itself, and one that names nothing, is reported closed at once. A peer's change is taken in and reported to no one. A command given while an offer is outstanding, and a verdict that names no offered change, are the host's faults, refused where they happen and counted in `refusals`. Nothing of a change of its own is sent to `#people` while it keeps a journal; joined again with `journal` false it sends its next change itself. Expected values come from a model of the list, not from a backend.",
  "steps": [
    {"note": "started: a copy that holds nothing", "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "0", "values": []}}},
    {"note": "the host names the copy, node 1, and says nothing of a journal: it keeps one", "event": "record_list.join", "data": {"node": "1"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "1"}}},
    {"note": "a person's edit closes a change: it is stamped and offered to the host whole, with the host's command, and nothing is taken in yet", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "now": "1727000500000", "command": "7"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.made", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}], "command": "7"}}], "variables": {"values": [], "adds": [], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 0}}},
    {"note": "the host gives the verdict, accepted: the change is taken in, then its outcome is reported", "event": "record_list.verdict", "data": {"wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "outcome": "accepted", "reason": null}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "7", "operations": 1, "reason": null, "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 0}}},
    {"note": "a peer's change, as the layer gives it, is taken in and reported to no one", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "2", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "6", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "393217", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 0}}},
    {"note": "a change of two commands begins: the first is held, and nothing is offered", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "now": "1727000501000", "more": true, "command": "8"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "6", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "393217", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 0}}},
    {"note": "the second ends it: one report of its three operations, every write-over before the write, named by the command that ended it", "event": "record_list.clear", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "now": "1727000501000", "more": false, "command": "9"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.made", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 1, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"kind": 1, "id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}], "command": "9"}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "6", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "393217", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 0}}},
    {"note": "a command given while the offer is outstanding is the host's fault: refused where it happens, counted, and nothing is staged or offered", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 7, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "late", "now": "1727000501100", "command": "10"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "6", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "393217", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 1}}},
    {"note": "a verdict that names another stamp than the offered change's is refused and counted, and the offer stays", "event": "record_list.verdict", "data": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 5, "outcome": "accepted", "reason": null}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "6", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000500000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "393217", "wallTime": "1727000500500", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "the verdict on the change, held (the layer held it already): taken in as an accepted one is, every operation, then the outcome", "event": "record_list.verdict", "data": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "outcome": "held", "reason": null}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "9", "operations": 3, "reason": null, "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "a change that names one register twice begins", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 8, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "a", "now": "1727000501100", "more": true, "command": "11"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "and is refused by the copy when it ends: nothing is offered, and the outcome is reported at once with its reason and no stamp", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 8, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "b", "now": "1727000501100", "command": "12"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "12", "operations": 0, "reason": "registerNamedTwice", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "a clear of a field that holds nothing names nothing: no change, reported at once as no operation and no refusal", "event": "record_list.clear", "data": {"id": 9, "field": 1, "now": "1727000501200", "more": false, "command": "13"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "13", "operations": 0, "reason": null, "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "a change is offered", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 10, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "now": "1727000501300", "command": "14"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.made", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 10, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}], "command": "14"}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "the verdict, waiting: the change is taken in provisionally, and the outcome reported as taken in", "event": "record_list.verdict", "data": {"wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "outcome": "waiting", "reason": null}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "14", "operations": 1, "reason": null, "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "655361", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "a change that writes over a value of the copy's own is offered: nothing moves but the clock", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "no", "now": "1727000501400", "command": "15"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.made", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 1, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "no", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}], "command": "15"}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "655361", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "the verdict, refused because the layer's log has no room: nothing is taken in, the values and the adds are those before the close, the clock stays at the refused stamp, and the outcome gives the layer's reason", "event": "record_list.verdict", "data": {"wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 0, "outcome": "refused", "reason": "noRoomForHistory"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#journal", "event": "record_list.closed", "data": {"command": "15", "operations": 0, "reason": "noRoomForHistory", "wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 0}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "655361", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "the host joins the same copy again without a journal", "event": "record_list.join", "data": {"node": "1", "journal": false}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "1", "refusals": 2}}},
    {"note": "its next change is taken in at once and sent whole to `#people`, reported to no one, and stamped after the refused one", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 11, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "sent", "now": "1727000501400", "command": "16"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#people", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 1, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 11, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "sent", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "maybe", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "11", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "sent", "wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000501000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "655361", "wallTime": "1727000501300", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "720897", "wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000501400", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 2}}}
  ]
}
